        "S002",
        "S003",
        "S004"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P014",
      "2. Separate and sort the pump materials, e.g. by:\n- Metals\n- Plastics\n- Rubber\n- Electronic waste\n- Greases and other lubricants",
