    [
      "P020",
      "4. TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION",
      true,
      "heading",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P021",
      "4.1. Work range",
      true,
      "heading",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S005",
        "S006"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P022",
      "The working range depends on the basic hydraulic design, the type of connection and sealings.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P023",
      "The module in the pumps with the strictest specification determines the allowable pressure and\ntemperature of the medium in the pumps.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P024",
      "Pumps with ATEX (explosion safety) marking, which are\napplied in explosive hazardous atmospheres, have an additional restriction of the medium\ntemperature.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P025",
      "The general working specifications can be summarized as follows:\nMedia temperature range for:\nLower limit temperature: - 20°C (minus 40°C for brine pumps in ductile iron with spec. seal)\nUpper limit temperature: +80°C for fresh water (up to 150°C with special shaft seal),\n+40°C for sea water (up to +60°C seawater in Super Duplex pumps\nwith special shaft seal)\n(The pump is suitable for pumping of clean fresh water with temperatures up to 100 C when ball bearing mounted on\npump shaft, and up to 140 C when without ball bearing mounted on pump shaft.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P026",
      "For pumping of clean fresh water with\ntemperatures above 100 C, DESMI only delivers ductile iron (for instance GGG40) or martensitic stainless steel (for\ninstance 1.4436) for pump casing and rear cover.)\nAmbient temperature range for:\nLower limit temperature: - 20 °C\nUpper limit temperature: + 45 °C\n(1.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P027",
      "Avoid freezing the pump.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P028",
      "2. If the ambient temperature exceeds the above value or the motor is located more than 1000 m above sea level, the\nmotor cooling is less effective and could require an adapted motor power.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P029",
      "Please contact your supplier for more detailed\nadvice.)\nMedia density and viscosity\nDensity: Max. 2500 kg/m3\nViscosity: Max. 500 cSt.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P030",
      "(Pumping liquids with a higher density and/or viscosity than water requires more mechanical torque from pump shaft and\nmore power from the electric motor.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P031",
      "This could cause overloading of the pump shaft and motor.",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
    [
      "P032",
      "Contact your supplier for\nadvice, if needed.)\nDESMI Pumping Technology A/S\nTagholm 1",
      true,
      "prose",
      "22:column:0",
      null,
      [
        "S007"
      ]
    ],
